 If you have a pick-axe there is a foolproof way to rob. First, take everything
you have or want down to the next level, without entering the shop. You should
already have killed all of the monsters. Drop everything except the pickaxe and
armor, maybe 1 food ration.

 Go back up and dig a tunnel along the top or bottom of the shop (a side with
no door). Stop at the last open square of floor and dig through the wall. The
message "The wall SEEMS too hard to dig in" is a hoax. Keep trying. When you
have broken through, dig a trapdoor at the corner. You will fall through. Come
up again, go through your new door (diagonally).
 
 Now steal everything you can carry, and walk out the new door and step onto
the trap door.


